 "ca_hinterland_wall_aquarium": {
  "area": "ca_hinterland_wall",
  "set": {
   "approach": "Where the North Gully descent ends at Tahquitz, at the Saint Pauly Girl slab, pick up a faint climbers' path that climbs up and left through a tight, steep gully to the Hinterland Wall. The Hinterland Wall is best reached from its right (west) side. The route starts at the far left side of the wall, in a left-facing dihedral."
  },
  "review": {
   "sources": [
    "https://www.mountainproject.com/area/114526490/hinterland-wall",
